# What graphify's own detector skips in this repo. Godot code (.gd/.tscn/.tres)
# is not affected: tools/graphify_godot.py extracts it and skips addons/ itself.

# Vendored third-party code (GUT and other plugins).
addons/

# Sound effects: graphify would try to transcribe them as speech.
*.ogg
*.wav
*.mp3

# Art assets: each image costs one vision subagent and adds little to a code map.
# Remove these lines to include them.
assets/
icon.svg

# Godot import sidecars and test save fixtures: generated data, not docs or code.
*.import
*.save
